{"availability":"available","full":"felixrieseberg/claude-coach","name":"claude-coach","description":"Claude as your endurance coach for marathons, triathlons, Ironman events, and more","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":194,"forks":28,"created":"2026-01-02T21:46:53Z","updated":"2026-10-05T15:32:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://felixrieseberg.github.io/claude-coach/","topics":["claude","claude-code","claude-skill","garmin","marathon","strava","triathlon","zwift"],"demo":"https://felixrieseberg.github.io/claude-coach/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:19.264Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:19.264Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:19.264Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:19.264Z","stars":194,"forks":28}],"technologies":["Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Claude Coach allows you to use Claude to create custom-tailored training programs for triathlons, marathons, and other endurance activities. Using a data-driven approach and principles from top training plans, Claude will create a training plan that's uniquely fit for you, your personal fitness, and the constraints you have in the next couple of weeks. Maybe you're recovering from an injury, maybe you're traveling and don't have access to a pool or track in a certain week - tell Claude about it and it'll create a plan that works for you.","The output is a beautiful training plan app that allows you to add, edit, or move workouts, mark them as complete, and update key training data like heart rate zones, LTHR, threshold paces, FTP, and others. Your data is kept locally in your browser.","Workouts can be exported as simple calendar events (.ics), Zwift (.zwo), Garmin (.fit), or TrainerRoad/ERG (.mrc) workouts."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/felixrieseberg/claude-coach/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"73fb37c0c82407585896c7b6826ed764e5ef1223fdc2816ae99f8ec49c3333bb","extractedA